CM_ SG_ 2019 SF_WriteChecksum "u16 BE: mode + sub + sum(data bytes).";
CM_ SG_ 2019 SF_ReadLength "Bytes requested (56, the last chunk shorter).";
CM_ SG_ 2019 SF_Seed "Security seed, u16 BE. 0 = already unlocked.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 SF_ResponseCode "72 accepted, 75 resend chunk, 77 bad checksum, 40 invalid (commit: SF_Detail = failure code), 21 busy, 33 access denied, 35 wrong key, 11 invalid mode, 22 (after 20 00) also counts as locked.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 FF_Pid16 "Live-data PID (mode 22/62). Value names from parameters.xml in BMSApp.jar.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 FF_SecurityLevel "5/6: tier 2 (password) seed/key; the 8-byte value follows. password = seed XOR key.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 FF_WriteSub "00 = 56-byte profile chunk: 3B 00 LL AAAA <LL bytes> <u16 checksum>.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 FF_Mode "Service mode of the multi-frame message.";
CM_ SG_ 2019 SF_Pid8 "One-byte PID / sub-function of the mode. For 03/07/0A replies the DTC count.";
